  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">See attached. The key development objective of this grant is to support the Directorate of National Statistics in the planning and implementation of its second national survey of living standards, and to provide training and technical assistance that is closely aligned to the Directorate&apos;s work program in relation to this survey operation in a manner that helps contributes to the process of institutionalization of the overall household survey program.</narrative>
